OL,3,GNEWSAScotland marks Remembrance Sunday
OL,4,Asilence for those who died in wars
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across Scotland have marked
OL,7,FRemembrance Sunday with a two-minute
OL,8,Fsilence, honouring the sacrifice of
OL,9,Fthose who died serving their country.
OL,11,FCommemorations in the capital began
OL,12,Fwith a military parade from Edinburgh
OL,13,FCastle down the Royal Mile, led by the
OL,14,FRAF Central Scotland Pipes and Drums.
OL,16,FVeterans, serving members of the armed
OL,17,Fforces and senior politicians paused at
OL,18,Fthe stone of remembrance to observe the
OL,19,Ftwo-minute silence.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
